===== epicshop auth   help
epicshop auth [subcommand] [domain]
Manage authentication for Epic domains (epicweb.dev, epicreact.dev, epicai.pro)
Positionals:
  subcommand  Auth subcommand (status, login, logout)
                                 [string] [choices: "status", "login", "logout"]
  domain      Domain to authenticate with (e.g., epicweb.dev, epicreact, epicai)
                                                                        [string]
Options:
  -s, --silent  Run without output logs               [boolean] [default: false]
  -h, --help    Show help                                              [boolean]
Examples:
  epicshop auth                    Show auth subcommand menu
  epicshop auth status             Show login status for all domains
  epicshop auth login              Login to a domain (interactive)
  epicshop auth login epicweb.dev  Login to EpicWeb.dev
  epicshop auth logout epicreact   Logout from EpicReact.dev
