===== epicshop diff   help
epicshop diff [app1] [app2]
Show differences between apps or playground vs solution (context-aware)
Positionals:
  app1  First app identifier (e.g., 01.02.problem). If omitted, prompts with
        playground vs solution as the default.                          [string]
  app2  Second app identifier (e.g., 01.02.solution)                    [string]
Options:
  -s, --silent        Run without output logs         [boolean] [default: false]
  -w, --workshop-dir  Path to a workshop directory to use as context (instead of
                      the current working directory)                    [string]
  -h, --help          Show help                                        [boolean]
Examples:
  epicshop diff                             Select apps to diff (defaults to
                                            playground vs solution)
  epicshop diff 01.02.problem               Show diff between two apps
  01.02.solution
