===== epicshop exercises   help
epicshop exercises [exercise] [step]
List exercises or show exercise details (context-aware)
Positionals:
  exercise  Exercise number or "context" to export all workshop context [string]
  step      Step number to show details for (e.g., 2 or 02)             [string]
Options:
      --json          Output as JSON                  [boolean] [default: false]
  -s, --silent        Run without output logs         [boolean] [default: false]
  -w, --workshop-dir  Path to a workshop directory to use as context (instead of
                      the current working directory)                    [string]
  -o, --output        Write context output to file (for exercises context
                      subcommand)                                       [string]
  -h, --help          Show help                                        [boolean]
Examples:
  epicshop exercises                        List all exercises with progress
  epicshop exercises context                Export all workshop context as JSON
  epicshop exercises context -o             Export context to file
  context.json
  epicshop exercises 1                      Show details for exercise 1
  epicshop exercises 1 2                    Show details for exercise 1 step 2
  epicshop exercises --json                 Output exercises as JSON
