===== epicshop playground   help
epicshop playground [subcommand] [target]
Manage the playground environment (context-aware)
Positionals:
  subcommand  Playground subcommand (show, set, saved)
                                      [string] [choices: "show", "set", "saved"]
  target      Target exercise step (e.g., 1.2.problem) or saved playground id
                                                                        [string]
Options:
  -e, --exercise      Exercise number                                   [number]
      --step          Step number                                       [number]
  -t, --type          App type (problem or solution)
                                       [string] [choices: "problem", "solution"]
      --list          List saved playgrounds (saved subcommand)
                                                      [boolean] [default: false]
      --latest        Use the most recent saved playground (saved subcommand)
                                                      [boolean] [default: false]
      --json          Output saved playgrounds as JSON (saved list)
                                                      [boolean] [default: false]
  -w, --workshop-dir  Path to a workshop directory to use as context (instead of
                      the current working directory)                    [string]
  -s, --silent        Run without output logs         [boolean] [default: false]
  -h, --help          Show help                                        [boolean]
Examples:
  epicshop playground                       Show current playground status
  epicshop playground show                  Show current playground status
  epicshop playground set                   Select a playground app to set
                                            (defaults to next step)
  epicshop playground set 1.2.problem       Set to specific step
  epicshop playground set --exercise 1      Set with options
  --step 2
  epicshop playground saved                 Interactively select a saved
                                            playground
  epicshop playground saved list            List saved playgrounds
  epicshop playground saved                 Set playground from a saved copy
